msgid "The site takes the dates of Ramadan from the Umm al-Qura calendar for every year up to 1473 AH (2051), and offers visitors the following day as an alternative start for countries that rely on local sighting. Articles, title tags and the night window switch to the next Ramadan the day after Eid, with no yearly update."
